mational">Trapezoid Sidestone RG</a></td><td>$5,900</td><td>$9,183</td><td>Statement tier. See <a href="/2-5-carat-marquise-diamond-price">2.5ct guide</a>.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>3ct marquise</strong></td><td>~$3,819 lab</td><td>~$54,687 natural</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/trapezoid-three-stone-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-5-8-ct-tw-by-bella-vaughan-item-203559?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">Trapezoid Three Stone WG (Bella Vaughan)</a></td><td>$9,115</td><td>$12,934</td><td>Statement tier. See <a href="/3-carat-marquise-diamond-price">3ct guide</a>.</td></tr></tbody></table>

